00:37:59.360 --> 00:38:01.310
Is there any limit
on the expiration

00:38:01.310 --> 00:38:03.740
for tokens and token refresh?

00:38:03.740 --> 00:38:04.770
So no limit on that.

00:38:04.770 --> 00:38:07.310
You can adjust what the
refresh time and what the limit

00:38:07.310 --> 00:38:08.310
is for the tokens.

00:38:08.310 --> 00:38:10.310
So you can specify
what the time to live

00:38:10.310 --> 00:38:13.010
is, how many refreshes they
get, and things like that.

00:38:13.010 --> 00:38:17.419
And that would be set to
whatever you want to set.

00:38:17.419 --> 00:38:19.460
So the next question,
