00:38:27.007 --> 00:38:28.340
But talk to your security folks.

00:38:28.340 --> 00:38:30.490
They usually have
requirements on this.

00:38:30.490 --> 00:38:32.334
What I've seen is a
lot of folks will match

00:38:32.334 --> 00:38:33.500
