00:38:33.500 --> 00:38:36.050
So whatever their session
timeout is for their web site,

00:38:36.050 --> 00:38:38.480
a lot of times their API is
going to be the same thing.

00:38:38.480 --> 00:38:42.620
30 minutes, 60 minutes for
things that are more sensitive.

00:38:42.620 --> 00:38:46.140
Longer if they're
not that sensitive.

